---
description: Mandatory implementation workflow for Aichestra
alwaysApply: true
---

Before implementation:

1. Read @AGENTS.md.
2. Read the Spec Kit constitution.
3. Read the active feature spec.
4. Read its plan and tasks.
5. Inspect the current repository before making assumptions.

Do not merely tell the user which commands to run when you can safely execute
them yourself.

During implementation:

- follow tasks in dependency order
- execute real commands
- run relevant tests after each meaningful batch
- fix failures
- continue until acceptance criteria are satisfied or a genuine external
  blocker exists

Do not create extra documentation or tests merely to make the task look more
complete.

Respect maintenance-reviewer decisions.

Do not silently weaken an acceptance criterion because implementation is
difficult.

If validation cannot be executed:

mark it explicitly as NOT VALIDATED
and state the concrete blocker.

Do not claim Windows or Linux live validation from macOS-only execution.
